sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D  as Device (D)
    participant AS as Auth Server (AS)

    Note over D,AS: Pre-stored at AS :  T_Acc = 0xFF...FF ,  K_GW-AS<br/>Pre-stored at D  :  (none — first contact)

    D->>AS: Registration Request

    Note over AS: Verify ID_D does not exist<br/>Generate PUF challenge :  c_D  (random)<br/>Generate session random  :  m_D  (random)

    AS-->>D: ( c_D ,  m_D )   [Secure Channel]

    Note over D: R_D      =  PUF_D(c_D)<br/>Generate group secret :  y_D<br/>Generate AS challenge :  c_AS-D<br/>Store  { y_D ,  c_D ,  m_curr = m_D }

    D-->>AS: ( y_D ,  R_D ,  c_AS-D )   [Secure Channel]

    Note over AS: Y_D^H    =  H(y_D)<br/>T_Acc    =  T_Acc  &  Y_D^H<br/>R_AS-D   =  PUF_AS(c_AS-D)<br/>Φ_AS-D   =  R_AS-D  ⊕  R_D<br/>Dual-state init:  m_curr = m_D ,  m_old = null<br/>PID_curr =  H( ID_D ∥ m_curr )   [initial pseudonym]<br/>PID_old  =  null<br/>Store  { T_Acc ,  ID_D ,  Φ_AS-D ,  c_AS-D ,  m_curr ,  m_old ,  PID_curr ,  PID_old }
